Learning Outcome

Successfully gained practical experience in implementing Apex Triggers and Trigger Handler architecture for real-world business automation. Learned how to automate record creation, perform calculations, validate data, manage relationships between Salesforce objects, and implement bulkified trigger logic. This strengthened the backend development capabilities of the Gym Management System.
